      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was never soft locked by the black screen before this open beta, and while I was still on it I'd estimate that it happened (and softlocked me) 33% of the time I traveled to worlds. The 3rd time it happened I swapped out of the beta.\n\nI also got a BSoD from something in the kernel attempting to write to read-only memory. I've saved the memory dump if it could be useful, but I won't be posting it publicly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
