      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It seems like this asynchronous deadlock issue is highly sensitive to CPU thread timing. High-end PCs with aggressive optimization might trigger this bug more easily, which explains why I've been experiencing this since the live release, while others are only starting to notice it now in the open beta as the code became more unstable.\n\n(Specs: Ryzen 9 7950X3D / RTX 4090) with launch option --affinity=0000FFFF(for CCD0 lock)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
